{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "c82ca5747ff3b094d59eb49f45dc05fc4818ac34a81216a1ab29167f26782165", "ja": "真剣だからこそ", "zh": "正因为认真", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a773c3ac10466053fc2ee64054ace7917aa280d8ad6465e6ba6e0facd74b13bb", "ja": "ツアーのセトリについて話し合う中、ロコと\n桃子の意見が対立してしまう。なだめる雪歩\nを一蹴し、ヒートアップしていくふたり。見\n守っていたプロデューサーは、そっと心の中\nでエールを送る。", "zh": "在讨论巡演曲目单时，ROCO和桃子的意见产生了分歧。雪步试图安抚两人，却被她们一口回绝，双方的争论愈演愈烈。一直在旁守望的制作人，则默默地在心中为她们加油。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "28580e8cb351fe76b6a682d7bc6aee5df39d6e7f0a66a693f1fd709db26f80e4", "ja": "（レッスンルームでは、アイドル達がセトリの相談中。\nロコと桃子の議論が、白熱しているらしい……）", "zh": "（练习室里，偶像们正在商量演出曲目。ROCO和桃子的讨论，似乎正越来越激烈……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "fa0eefd6d09bd4f73b4351a457c72b2e30b59f7a669ce3025ec4dba3ad0c3dd2", "ja": "今回のセトリは、アバンギャルドに行きましょう！\nさらにエキゾチックでスペーシーに……これです！", "zh": "这次的演出曲目，就走前卫路线吧！\n再加上异国风情和太空感……就是这个！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "64b4f5d29c20017ac716d746e704ae395600aadd17dc5bfa5813bdd03cc24058", "ja": "え、何これロコさん。桃子、ちょっとよく\nわかんない……っていうか、奇をてらいすぎじゃない？", "zh": "咦，这是什么，ROCO先生。桃子有点搞不懂……不对，这是不是太刻意追求新奇了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "308888b4c8ebe8cca79f876be50fa8d9a4efce60d03c314202262d457a1d288c", "ja": "大事なのはお客さんが何を観たいかでしょ？\n演者の独りよがりになっちゃダメ！", "zh": "重要的应该是观众想看什么吧？\n可不能变成表演者的一厢情愿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "41a8d0f19f97fbaf716ad2cc9cedc34a55b4787e853b5c13bad54ac3e509cb37", "ja": "むむむ……お、オーディエンスも、マンネリズムからの\n脱却を求めてるって思います！　ね、セリカ？", "zh": "唔唔唔……罗、罗可觉得观众也在\n寻求摆脱千篇一律的现状哦！对吧，星梨花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "20e50e826f927f8890e8843c7efdceb8cc84f323994a724fcb40d645c462c640", "ja": "あ、え、えーと……あはは。\n奈緒さんはどう思いますか？", "zh": "啊，呃，那个……啊哈哈。\n奈绪姐姐觉得怎么样呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "b9369be5247fb18daed3a1b195622ed7a8b0a550ec8d2e0a995fa71ef1b32873", "ja": "わ、私！？　……えっと、う～ん……せやな……。\n星梨花、そんなキラーパスしてくるなんて反則やで！", "zh": "我、我吗！？……那个，唔～……这个嘛……\n星梨花，突然甩这么难接的锅过来太犯规了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1007_025roc", "source_sha256": "0f25cbdffe3bc0a2e3d11ea9f8962f5c762a14e559e5c639bb490273a4102341", "ja": "ほら、ふたりともロコ案に賛成みたいですよ。\nオーディエンスもアバンギャルドを求めてます！", "zh": "你看，你们两个好像都赞成ROCO方案呢。观众们也想要前卫风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "4a15bc7c4fce39e5206faffb06938245f44ab4f4c3528ab80eaf42f6f6e7634e", "ja": "求めてないよ！　こんなことしたら、また765プロは\nトンチキって思われちゃう！　桃子は王道がいい！", "zh": "才不是呢！要是做这种事，765制作人又会被人觉得很离谱的！桃子想走王道路线上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "884f0d9584d44325f1d1006e9564126608b3b32321209a35a8aea4217a2dc395", "ja": "ロコは、アバンギャルドがいいです！　\nここは折れませんよ！", "zh": "ROCO要走前卫路线！  \n这点我可不会让步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9b31bdb41229b055e79355dc0bed3387a76d7b2aff66408c03fe25de9969a4d6", "ja": "うう、ふたりとも……。", "zh": "呜呜，你们两个都……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "fc5a8acea1d9c38ceaf6d1836b2fdce043f95e50c3ffd1391c284dea51f41a44", "ja": "王道！", "zh": "王道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "3096852ae88ecaf10881498b15d2c7d3227ff211fbcb7f2cffdd8509aa1b7273", "ja": "アバンギャルド！", "zh": "前卫！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "19ef18de5e43720bbd721dc099578520ad33ce109aa0f963bc4a6989dd4f0e29", "ja": "ふ、ふたりとも！　喧嘩しないで！\nせ、折衷案で行こうよ～！", "zh": "你、你们两个！别吵架！\n要、要不采取折中方案吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "279502cfb5f9cf85341337ebf1ec3483bcad554890d2a57b72ca0f68f712a792", "ja": "ユキホ・雪歩さんは黙ってて！", "zh": "Yukiho·雪步小姐，请先别说话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "6b0cb764bc159865cd228de9262dc3c2586914752d2372217a014c40fb93c350", "ja": "雪歩さんは黙ってて！", "zh": "雪步姐闭嘴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3fcb4c6924a9534ab5b7377ad477f3d345e280f69e4cffd8a9421481fbbb077f", "ja": "ひうぅっ……！", "zh": "呜呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1017_p", "source_sha256": "aa266b420a1c09e0dc74c1f27702a98afb4793efb144c1292c749e92d7f2fde4", "ja": "みんな……ずいぶん議論が白熱しているようだな。\nその……あんまり喧嘩しないようにな。", "zh": "大家……好像讨论得相当激烈啊。\n那个……尽量别吵起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "92ef0cb2d7b2a28e28ad42a7f023f3d11b0c9eef70c8f4dd73b2a1a78fee3c0e", "ja": "わあっ！！　{$P$}さん\nいたんですか！？", "zh": "哇！！{$P$}先生\n您在这里啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "3a80d7076c722c6e7d601bce34d3b785e564589a9142ef981edf880add9ee4aa", "ja": "いるよ、ずっといたよ……ははっ……。", "zh": "我在啊，一直都在……哈哈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0259_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0259_story_03_1020_p", "source_sha256": "bd549e437e14cc672e898f55257421f1f1bf58899bb2fe27913b0c5b91c21756", "ja": "（なかなか決まりそうにないが、みんなを信じよう。\nきっといいセトリができるはずだ……！）", "zh": "（看来一时半会儿定不下来，不过还是相信大家吧。一定能做出一份很棒的歌单……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
